⍝ 06 · Statistics: mean, median, mode, standard deviation, a histogram
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/06-statistics.apls

x←23 45 12 67 34 45 89 21 45 56 34 78
Mean←{(+/⍵)÷≢⍵}
Median←{s←⍵[⍋⍵] ⋄ n←≢⍵ ⋄ Mean s[(⌈n÷2),1+⌊n÷2]}
Mode←{⊃⍸(⊢=⌈/)+⌿⍵∘.=∪⍵}   ⍝ index (into ∪⍵) of the most frequent
SD←{(Mean(⍵-Mean ⍵)*2)*0.5}

⎕←'data:   ',⍕x
⎕←'mean:   ',⍕Mean x
⎕←'median: ',⍕Median x
⎕←'mode:   ',⍕(∪x)[Mode x]
⎕←'sd:     ',⍕SD x
⎕←'range:  ',⍕(⌊/x),⌈/x

⍝ Text histogram in bins of 20: ⌸ (key) counts how many fall in each bin
bins←20×⌊x÷20
h←bins{⍺,≢⍵}⌸bins
h←h[⍋h[;1];]
⎕←'histogram:'
⎕←↑⊃¨{(¯3↑⍕⍺),'-',(¯3↑⍕⍺+19),' │',⍵⍴'█'}/¨↓h   ⍝ /¨ reduces each row; ⊃¨ unwraps
